<title>USA: UAL Corp Q1 fully distributed oper shr up.</title>
<headline>UAL Corp Q1 fully distributed oper shr up.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-04-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>1997			1996</p>
<p> Oper shr		   $1.61		    $0.72</p>
<p> Oper net		 215,000		  105,000</p>
<p> Revs		   4,121,000		3,735,000</p>
<p> Avg shrs		 131,900		  131,300</p>
<p>(All Data Above 000s Except Per Share Numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: Results are on a fully distributed basis, taking into account all employee stock ownership plan (ESOP) shares.</p>
<p>Year-ago Q1 earnings are before loss of $29.0 million or $0.22/shr on debt extinguishment.</p>
